feat(ocale): add poll-until-done-core polling loop

pollUntilDoneCore(deps, ref, options) polls tasks.get on each
iteration with configurable pollDelay (defaults to defaultRetryDelay),
wall-clock timeoutMs (default 300s), and AbortSignal support.

Terminal states are COMPLETE, FAILED, and CANCELLED.
Timeout returns PollTimeoutError with lastObservedTask.
Abort returns PollAbortedError with AbortSignal.reason.
Transport errors propagate as-is.

